* MLIB1 -- Music library inquiry screen
MAP MLIB1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD USERID    AT 0,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD SEARCH    AT 3,20  LEN 30 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD TRACKID   AT 6,20  LEN 12 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD TITLE     AT 7,20  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD ARTIST    AT 8,20  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD DURSECS   AT 9,20  LEN 6  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD CATEGORY  AT 9,30  LEN 20 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD MTYPE     AT 9,52  LEN 4  PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD STATF     AT 9,58  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD LASTPLAY  AT 10,20 LEN 10 PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD MESSAGE   AT 14,5  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
